<% /*
==========================================================
MILK COLLECTION PAGE

FILE:
views/milk.ejs

PURPOSE:
----------------------------------------------------------
• Display all currently milking dairy animals
• Display morning / evening milk records
• Allow normal users to submit milk
• Allow administrators to edit existing records
• Show current collection session
• Show success / failure through a popup only

EXPECTED CONTROLLER DATA:
----------------------------------------------------------
dairies
session
isAdmin
user
success
error

IMPORTANT RESULT RULE:
----------------------------------------------------------
The result popup must ONLY appear when:

    success === true
    success === "1"

OR when error contains an actual message.

Opening /milk normally must NEVER display
the result popup.

EACH DAIRY MAY CONTAIN:
----------------------------------------------------------
dairy._id
dairy.name
dairy.code
dairy.isMilking

dairy.morning
dairy.evening

dairy.morningRecorded
dairy.eveningRecorded

dairy.morningLiters
dairy.eveningLiters

SESSION VALUES:
----------------------------------------------------------
morning
closed
evening

==========================================================
*/ %>


<style>

